                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for the review. misc-include-cleaner is enabled in .clang-tidy. CodeRabbit on our internal review applies stricter rules \u2014 every used symbol must come from a directly included header \u2014 which is how this patch was produced. If upstream follows the clang-tidy standard, I'll abandon this patch. Much appreciated."
